  <diagram id="hybrid-placement" name="10 - Where the hybrid sits">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1422" dy="820" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="1080" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="x1" value="Where the hybrid sits — placement is the tool list" style="text;html=1;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="24" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x2" value="The hybrid is not a third transport. It is that the two connections are built with different tool lists, and the server decides which." style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#6b6b6b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="68" width="1600" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x3" value="THE CONSTRAINT — protocol shape, not a preference" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="1500" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x4" value="WebRTC   model —function_call→ BROWSER data channel → browser runs it → browser injects the result.    The server is never in that loop.
Relay     model —function_call→ YOUR SERVER → server runs it in-process → server injects the result.    The browser never sees it.

So a tool the browser must not see is a tool WebRTC cannot offer. Placement removes it from that line rather than hiding it there." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#909090;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="132" width="1510" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x5" value="DIRECT LINE — gpt-realtime · voice   (WebRTC)" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;rounded=0;swimlaneFillColor=#eef4fc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="240" width="730" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x6" value="SESSION BUILT WITH 6 TOOLS" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="48" width="690" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x7" value="list_supported_regions · rank_airports · compare_airports
get_airport_profile · get_flight_mix · end_call" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="68" width="690" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x8" value="get_airport_weather — NOT DECLARED HERE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="116" width="690" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x9" value="WHO RUNS THEM" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="152" width="690" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x10" value="The browser. live/tools.js → POST /api/tool → engine → result injected back into the data channel." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="172" width="690" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x11" value="WHAT THE MODEL IS TOLD" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="214" width="690" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x12" value="NOT AVAILABLE ON THIS CONNECTION — get_airport_weather is not offered on this line. Say so
in one sentence and name the switch.
Without this, a model handed six tools where its instructions imply seven answers the seventh from
memory — which is how a caller who asked for the weather got a score summary." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="234" width="690" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x13" value="LATENCY" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="318" width="690" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x14" value="Roughly 340–900 ms to first sound. Echo cancellation, jitter buffering and loss concealment come free." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="338" width="690" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x15" value="&lt;div dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;מה הדפדפן רואה:&lt;/b&gt; כל קריאת כלי וכל תוצאה שהמודל מקבל.&lt;br&gt;זה לא ניתן לשינוי בטרנספורט הזה — ולכן כלי רגיש פשוט לא מוצע כאן.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=right;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="x5"><mxGeometry x="18" y="382" width="690" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x16" value="RELAYED LINE — via your server   (WebSocket)" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;rounded=0;swimlaneFillColor=#f0f7ee;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="240" width="730" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x17" value="SESSION BUILT WITH ALL 7 TOOLS" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="48" width="690" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x18" value="the six above, plus:" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="68" width="690" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x19" value="get_airport_weather — runs here, in-process" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="100" width="690" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x20" value="WHO RUNS THEM" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="136" width="690" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x21" value="The server. relay.js calls runTool() directly. Nothing crosses to the browser but audio." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="156" width="690" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x22" value="WHAT THE MODEL IS TOLD" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="198" width="690" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x23" value="Nothing extra. Nothing is withheld, so there is no gap to explain." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="218" width="690" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x24" value="LATENCY" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="258" width="690" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x25" value="Four to five times the direct line — 1,611 ms measured against roughly 340 ms. Echo cancellation and
jitter buffering are lost. conversation.item.truncate is not sent on barge-in, because only the browser
knows where playback actually stopped." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="278" width="690" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x26" value="&lt;div dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;מה הדפדפן רואה:&lt;/b&gt; אודיו בלבד. התמלול, התשובות וקריאות הכלים — כולם בשרת.&lt;br&gt;זה המחיר וזו גם התמורה.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=right;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="x16"><mxGeometry x="18" y="352" width="690" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x27" value="ENFORCED IN THREE PLACES — any one alone is theatre" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="1500" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x28" value="1.  THE SESSION
buildRealtimeSession(query, &quot;browser&quot;) returns six tools,
so the model cannot ask for the seventh." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#909090;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="762" width="480" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x29" value="2.  THE DOOR
POST /api/tool returns 403 for placement:&quot;server&quot; — every
caller, always. That endpoint IS how a browser would reach it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="762" width="490" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x30" value="3.  THE MODEL
Told what is withheld and which switch moves the call to the
line where it works, so the gap is named rather than improvised." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#909090;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="762" width="480" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x31" value="WHY get_airport_weather AND NOTHING ELSE" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="852" width="1500" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x32" value="Every other tool is a pure read over a local, read-only dataset — the browser seeing that result costs nothing. get_airport_weather is the one call that leaves the building, so a browser-reachable endpoint for it is an open proxy through this server address.
That is the line: a tool is server-placed when the risk is in the CALL, not in the answer." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#909090;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="874" width="1510" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x33" value="&lt;div dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;עדיין פתוח:&lt;/b&gt; ל-POST /api/tool אין אימות כלל. הוא יסרב עכשיו למזג אוויר לכל קורא, אבל את ששת כלי הקריאה הוא מריץ לכל מי שמגיע לפורט, וה-session id שהוא רושם ביומן נוצר בדפדפן ולכן אינו ראיה לכלום. התיקון: טוקן קצר-חיים שנטבע יחד עם המפתח הזמני, נדרש בנקודת הקצה, ומשמש כמזהה הסשן האמיתי.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=right;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="946" width="1510" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
